WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.900
Now then, it's time for the finishing touches.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.900
The finishing touches for the destruction of the Astral World!

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.010
Finishing touches?

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.010
What do you mean by "destruction of the Astral World"?!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.050
Simply this.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.420
You two will be the shells that will destroy the Astral World.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.320
Shot by the Sphere Field Cannon!

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:32.920
Shell? Sphere Field Cannon?

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.660
Yuma, look down.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:36.450
Huh?

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.300
This is... The waste disposal plant from the other day!

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.000
Right now, you will be sent to the muzzle of the Sphere Field Cannon,

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:53.000
and it is aiming for the Astral World!

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:54.520
- What?!
- What?!

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:59.690
<i>Then, this is... the memory from my world, when...</i>

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.750
The attack level will be much different than before.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:09.900
Because within the Sphere Field, the power of all the Numbers will be concentrated into one shell.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.240
One strike with this blast and the Astral World will be...

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:25.960
Haruto!

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.320
Where is Haruto?

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:33.130
Orbital! Search for Haruto's whereabouts! Immediately!

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.960
U-Understood!

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:38.810
For that... For that, you had...

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:40.240
...Kaito collect Numbers?!

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:46.430
The World Duel Carnival has been organized to collect the Numbers.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:51.240
It was a bit of a pity that Kaito has been defeated by Byron,

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.840
but that could have been expected.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:59.190
In short... with you collecting all the Numbers in the Final,

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:01.950
my goal has been accomplished.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:07.730
That means, me and Tron, Shark, Kaito, plus III and his brothers...

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:11.110
...all the participants have been nothing but your tools?!

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:18.020
You jerk...! Stop screwing with us!

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.400
What?!

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:23.740
It will happen any minute now.

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:29.700
Well, Haruto! This will be your last mission.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.070
Haruto...

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:34.930
Are you absolutely positive?

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:35.570
Yes!

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:40.920
Haruto-<i>sama</i> is underneath the tower, at the underground disposal site.

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:42.950
Haruto should be safe there.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.840
He might be safe there, just... in the place Haruto-<i>sama</i> is right now,

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:51.500
Haruto-<i>sama</i> himself will become a part of the Sphere Field Canon and...

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.550
What did you say?!

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.280
Haruto! Haruto!

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.070
Hey, Haruto! Haruto!

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:05.640
Well, Haruto, you can trigger it all by yourself,

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:08.770
and destroy the Astral World!

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.720
Haruto is the trigger?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.580
I understand now! The energy of the Numbers will be the shell,

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:18.320
which will be fired by Haruto's power!

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:21.780
Soon it will be accomplished.

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:25.070
Then the Astral World will be destroyed an I will receive the power of Varian,

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:28.400
to rule the world as I desire!

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.900
Haruto!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:42.150
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:47.700
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:04.400
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:10.100
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:14.710
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:20.530
<i>It's too soon for us to turn back now</i>

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:25.930
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:31.210
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:37.170
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:42.580
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:47.750
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:53.190
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:59.580
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:05.450
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.370
Everyone all right?

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.120
Hey, where is Kotori?

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.330
"Number 68: The Overture Towards Destruction!
 The Threat of Sphere Field Cannon!"

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.250
I don't see her anywhere!

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:19.790
Perhaps she ran off to Yuma!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:24.970
Akari-<i>san</i>!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.180
Is everyone okay?

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.390
Yuma disappeared along with the field...

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.260
And Kotori too...

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:32.600
What did you say?!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:43.610
No way!

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:46.450
Yuma!

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.620
Thi... this is...?!

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.170
Neo Galaxy-Eyes, given to me by Haruto's power...

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.260
Are you suffering, Haruto...?

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.600
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.570
Very good. that's a good boy, Haruto.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.530
The ruin of the Astral World is approaching.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:31.530
The moment I reach my goal is coming closer!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.540
Kotori-<i>chan</i>? You hear me, Kotori-<i>chan</i>?

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.540
Answer me... Kotori-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:43.590
Kotori-<i>chan</i>?!

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.000
Akari-<i>san</i>?

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:47.970
Kotori-<i>chan</i>... Thank goodness.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.130
Are you somewhere safe?

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.550
Right now, I am beneath the Heart Tower.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.560
The Heart Tower? Why there?

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.980
Yuma must be around here!

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.310
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:03.110
Kaito-<i>sama</i>! Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.360
That's... Kaito!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.530
Akari-<i>san</i>, excuse me. I have to hang up.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.740
Huh? Wait, Kotori-<i>chan</i>! Kotori-<i>chan</i>!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:13.950
Kotori-<i>chan</i>...

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.040
<i>Yuma... where... where are you?</i>

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.630
<i>Oh... this is...</i>

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.970
Use more power!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.720
U-Understood!

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.850
Just a bit and we've got it.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.140
Out of the way!

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.190
Shark!

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:45.940
Aren't you that guy from the other day...!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.110
I'll lift the rubble up.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.440
Use that chance to pull him out.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.360
Hurry it up!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.820
Ye... yes!

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:02.710
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.670
Thank you, Shark.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:05.960
No need for thanks.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:07.880
Take that guy and get away!

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:10.920
I can't get away...

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.930
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.640
While we are talking, Haruto will...

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.230
What about Haruto-<i>kun</i>?

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.190
What is happening with Haruto-<i>kun</i>?

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:25.060
That... it is...

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:25.940
Orbital!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.730
Hey, answer me!

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.990
Answer! What is happening with Haruto-<i>kun</i>?!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:36.570
That... He is a part of the Sphere Field Cannon.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.200
Sphere Field Cannon?!

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:44.670
That's the ultimate weapon to destroy the Astral World.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:51.010
Dr. Faker made Kaito-<i>sama</i> collect
 the Numbers to fill it with energy and-

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.130
Where is he now?

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.880
Where will the Sphere Field Cannon launch?

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:56.180
Where?!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.640
There's no time. Let's go, Orbital.

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.430
Wait! We aren't finished yet!

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.020
Upset that I didn't say thank you?

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:10.230
Unfortunately... I don't know words like 'thank you'.

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.110
So there's no use expecting it from me.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.570
That's not what I mean!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.910
Or do you want a Duel?

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.780
Save it for later, then.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:22.370
Though, I was positive we already settled the score.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:28.380
You...

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.420
Shut up! Next time I'll beat you, just you see!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.340
What are you two doing?!

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.720
Now's not the time for this!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.510
You shut up too!

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:43.390
I don't want any thanks, or a Duel with this guy!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:44.850
I want...

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.730
I just want to help Yuma!

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.940
He's probably still inside the Sphere Field.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.030
And if it is a weapon...

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.240
No way!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.030
I can't leave Yuma like that!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:04.330
He's the guy who beat Tron in my place!

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.410
Answer, you stupid robot!

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:10.000
Where will the Sphere Field Cannon launch?!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:16.090
I am not a stupid robot! If you keep on saying that, I won't say a thing!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.720
Please. I would like to help Yuma as well.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:25.100
And Haruto-<i>kun</i>, of course! And Yuma too always worried about Haruto-<i>kun</i>.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.480
Even you understand that, don't you?

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.940
<i>But I promised Haruto!</i>

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:37.700
<i>....who else is gonna protect Haruto!?</i>

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.580
<i>I'll protect Haruto, so focus on the Duel for now!</i>

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.960
So that's why I'm begging you both to work together to save them both?!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:50.880
Let's go, Orbital.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:51.960
Understood!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:52.880
Kaito!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.420
If you want to help, come along.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.550
Haruto and Yuma should be at the underground waste disposal sight.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:00.720
Waste disposal sight?

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.050
Over there?

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.850
My body is... getting so heavy.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.190
No use... I can't stand up anymore.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:21.240
It's all my fault. My power is getting weaker and weaker.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:22.660
Astral!

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:25.330
Yuma...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.620
At the very least, I want to get you out of here.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.670
Don't be silly... I can't leave you alone in here.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.840
Me and you... and Haruto... We'll be saved together.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.590
I won't give up until the very end!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.510
I'll bring it to...

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:50.680
Useless. The underground passage is blocked off!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:53.230
Isn't there another way?

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.020
Check it, Orbital.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:56.190
Understood!

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:59.110
Although I have to say, from here I won't be able to...

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:03.110
...access the host computer to identify the points which-

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:05.950
You can't do that?! You stupid robot!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.580
How about you helping, you long haired punk!

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.250
I know! Perhaps Akari-<i>san</i>!

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.760
Yes, I got it. Listen, Kotori-<i>chan</i>.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.680
From where you are, on the third block to the left, are stairs.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.180
These will lead you to the underground!

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.020
As expected, Akari-<i>san</i>! Thank you so much! You were a huge help!

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:37.270
But don't push yourselves too hard!
Be careful, Kotori!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.650
To summarize, we can only rely on...

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:43.820
... Kotori now. I'm leaving Yuma to you!

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.320
We need to stick together!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.200
Everyone, over there!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:53.160
<i>I just know it. I have to save them, for the sake of everyone.</i>

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:56.250
<i>Therefore, stay safe, Yuma!</i>

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.760
There's Haruto-<i>sama</i> in front!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.940
I was expecting you, Kaito.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:25.530
Perhaps the painful screams of your little brother were resonating in your ears?

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:27.740
You bastard...

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:39.540
Haruto...

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.840
Haruto, Haruto!

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:45.380
Yuma... Yuma is there too!

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:56.600
Whoever dares to stand in Dr. Faker's way will not be forgiven!

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.520
Go, crush them!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.860
Crush these annoying people!

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:13.620
<i>. . . Cleaning . . . Cleaning . . . Cleaning . . . Cleaning . . . Cleaning . . . Cleaning . . .</i>

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.290
Fight them back, Orbital!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:19.670
Understood!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.760
I'm coming!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.590
Excuse me!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.260
Beg your pardon!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.940
Oh, that was a good one!

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.900
Stop admiring me and try harder yourself!

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.320
U-Understood...

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.700
<i>. . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . .</i>

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.160
Damn, there's even more of them coming!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.210
If this goes on, then Haruto...

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:03.250
Don't you worry. Haruto will complete his mission very well.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.420
What?!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:10.510
Because it is his desire to help Dr. Faker, his father.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.300
Stop joking!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:17.270
I am not only not joking, but very happy indeed.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:23.860
Dr. Faker's dream will become a reality very soon.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.610
And his dream is connected to mine.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:32.530
That is why I bet everything on Dr. Faker-<i>sama</i>.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:37.410
And that is why I won't let anyone cause any trouble for him.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:41.580
You all can right out disappear together with Yuma Tsukumo!

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:47.960
So, I'll open the gates to hell now!

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:58.140
What... is this?!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:04.230
The space underneath is connected to the Astral World.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.570
This will be an eternal farewell to you all!

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:12.860
This guy wants to dispose of us like trash!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.160
If we fall into that hole...

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:18.410
Haruto...

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:26.340
Any moment, Haruto will turn into the trigger of the Sphere Field Cannon.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:30.800
With this, my expectations as a father,

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:35.260
and my desires will be achieved!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.140
Go! Beat them into that pit!

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:50.190
<i>. . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . . Trash . . .</i>

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:52.990
They keep coming out...

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:56.910
Hey, you stupid robot, don't you have any ideas to counter them?

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.910
Who is calling me a stupid robot?! You nasty shark!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.370
It's not the time for quarreling!

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:06.420
These Obots move on orders from somewhere.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.920
If we find that location, we can destroy it.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.550
Oh! Why haven't I thought of that?!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.220
I'll investigate immediately.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:18.220
All orders are transmitted by the main computer,

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:22.310
If I hijack that and inject a high voltage shock...

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.600
Got it! Over there!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.360
I don't need the explanation! Get going!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:32.230
Stop ordering me around! I am not your servant!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.240
Do it, Orbital!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:35.900
U-Understood!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.780
Orbital Step!

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:42.330
I'll bring my service to 'em!

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.620
And this is solely my turn!

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:48.880
I overcharge the main computer with a high voltage shock!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.800
Wha... what's happening?

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:58.220
What?!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:01.050
Orbital!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.350
They stopped moving!

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.730
Im... impossible?!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.980
Haruto's energy is decreasing?!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.780
Oh?! Wha... what is happening!?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.200
Wa... Wait!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:24.910
Someone! Can someone save me, anyone! Please...!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:27.210
Orbital!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.380
Well done, Orbital!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:37.010
Kaito-<i>sama</i> praised me... I wished for that my whole life...

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.800
Orbital... Thank you.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.520
What... what has happened?

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.110
Over there...!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:59.240
Kotori! Shark! Kaito! You here...?!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:02.740
The energy of the Sphere Field Cannon is decreasing.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.290
Maybe it will work now...

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.250
Yuma, deactivate ZEXAL!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:10.500
Astral!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.630
Astral...

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.430
Go, Yuma.

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:24.350
Huh?

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.310
Only you can escape now.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.890
What are you saying? You have to escape as well!

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.480
I can't do that.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:38.110
Right now, I only can exist inside the Sphere Field,

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:42.030
because I am the embodiment of the Numbers.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:44.410
Tha... That is...

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:49.960
These are...

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:51.290
Hope.

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.250
And the future.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.300
Astral... You...?!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.380
You have to go now, Yuma.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:05.970
Go save the Astral World and help Haruto.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.900
The future is entrusted to you.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:26.370
Yuma!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:27.870
Yuma!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.450
That... hurts...

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.460
You don't stop causing me trouble!

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:40.710
But whatever you try, it will be useless!

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:45.510
Soon you will be eliminated, together with the Astral World!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.850
With this Sphere Field Cannon!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.430
Dr. Faker!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:54.560
Oh!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:21:00.650
I see! That's what you meant! I got it, Astral!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:05.530
Shark, Kaito! Lend me your power, please!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:10.540
Please protect the hope and the future that Astral has entrusted on me.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.460
Hope and Future...?!

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.380
<i>So you entrusted them to me as well...</i>

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.550
<i>...hope and the future.</i>

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.600
Our hearts are resolved!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.180
The future of everyone is at stake!

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:38.480
We challenge you to a Duel, Dr. Faker!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:43.570
Interesting.

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:48.620
Until the auto restoration of the main computer is completed, I will accept for entertainment purposes.

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:52.580
Also, the Numbers have to be collected again.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:55.960
Very well, I will be your opponent.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.090
<i>Yuma... Kaito... Shark...</i>

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:02.880
<i>The hope of everyone is depending on you three and you three alone.</i>

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:05.090
<i>Please protect it,</i>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:07.050
<i>the future!</i>

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:15.850
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:21.310
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:32.080
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:36.290
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:37.580
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:40.290
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:42.920
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:48.130
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:53.470
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:59.100
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:05.570
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:11.240
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:22.040
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:27.380
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:32.840
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:41.730 --> 00:23:44.190
The last Duel against Dr. Faker has finally started!

00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:46.400
And his Number finally makes an appearance!

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:48.360
How can we loose this?!

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:51.740
Shark, Kaito, let us unite our powers!

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:54.160
What kind of form is this?

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:56.240
It's truly the strongest Number!

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:59.040
Let's go! Let's show him the power of our bonds!

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:01.790
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:04.630
"The Three Heroes Unite! One Last Duel For The Future!"

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:07.880
The destiny of the worlds now is entrusted to you...

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.260
Dr. Faker, this is our final battle!

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:16.640
Kaito, Shark, you came too?!

00:24:16.970 --> 00:24:19.020
Just be sure not to hold me back!

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:22.310
No matter how you look at it, you're the one holding them back, Yuma.

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:23.810
I knew you'd say that.
